            "intro_en": "Before a cliffside cave dwelling, an old man covered in dragon tattoos sits cross-legged by a fire, his rasping voice rumbling like a dragon's growl.\n\"Little one, daring to tread the domain of dragons... have you the nerve to face the trial?\"",
